Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:29:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] presentation: keep panorama columns stable while navigation
 collapses

Port the width-based Shaped lane policy from Anikku 0046; retain Mihon minLane caps and incremental relayout. Navigation chrome changes viewport height during browsing, which must not change column count.
